   "innerHTML": "<h4><a href=\"https://bing.com\">Energy-efficient buildings →</a></h4><p><span class=\"fontSizeMediumPlus\">Learn about our efforts to make our office buildings more energy-efficient using solar panels, smart energy management systems, and sustainable building materials.</span></p>"
